     1	# Story 3.2: Show Public Readiness and Current Ops State
     2	
     3	Status: done
     4	
     5	<!-- Note: Validation is optional. Run validate-create-story for quality check before dev-story. -->
     6	
     7	## Story
     8	
     9	As a venue operator,
    10	I want to see whether the display is current, reduced-confidence, or unavailable,
    11	so that I can decide quickly whether it is fit for public use.
    12	
    13	## Acceptance Criteria
    14	
    15	1. Given the display and ops surface are running, when a venue operator checks the ops status view, then the current public state is shown as current, reduced-confidence, or unavailable, and the status reflects the same readiness model used by the public display.
