Implemented Story 3.4 end to end. The ops surface now has a server-only maintenance path for `refresh` and `trust-check`, a local-only `POST` endpoint at [src/app/api/ops/actions/route.ts](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/api/ops/actions/route.ts), and a compact client action panel wired into the existing ops shell via [src/features/ops/components/OpsShellClient.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/components/OpsShellClient.tsx), [src/features/ops/components/OpsActionPanel.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/components/OpsActionPanel.tsx), and [src/features/ops/hooks/useOpsHealthQuery.ts](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/hooks/useOpsHealthQuery.ts). The server helper in [src/lib/server/ops/run-ops-maintenance-action.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/ops/run-ops-maintenance-action.js) reuses the existing dashboard pipeline, forces publish only for refresh, uses the latest available snapshot for trust-check, and returns calm bounded action results.

Supporting changes are in [src/lib/server/dashboard/dashboard-service.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/dashboard/dashboard-service.js), [src/lib/server/ops/create-ops-actions-route-response.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/ops/create-ops-actions-route-response.js), [src/lib/vendor/tanstack-react-query.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/vendor/tanstack-react-query.tsx), [src/features/ops/ops-shell-view.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/ops-shell-view.js), [src/features/ops/ops-shell-content.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/ops-shell-content.js), and [src/app/globals.css](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/globals.css). Regression coverage was added in [tests/unit/ops-maintenance-action.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-maintenance-action.test.mjs) and [tests/unit/ops-shell.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-shell.test.mjs).

