**Findings Fixed**

- Medium: duplicate-submit protection in [`useOpsMaintenanceActionMutation.ts`](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/hooks/useOpsMaintenanceActionMutation.ts#L44) was only UI-deep. Two rapid triggers could race before the disabled state committed. I added an in-flight promise gate at [`#L48-L53`](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/hooks/useOpsMaintenanceActionMutation.ts#L48).
