 ### Completion Notes List
 
-- Created the Story 3.5 implementation-ready artifact with concrete tasks tied to the current dashboard snapshot, fallback, and ops-health architecture.
-- Scoped the story to restart-aware recovery, honest carried-forward rendering, and local-only ops confirmation rather than new maintenance surfaces or process-control tooling.
