Implemented Story 3.5 end to end. Cold-start restart recovery now restores the last safe public picture immediately, tracks explicit recovery state in [recovery-state.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/dashboard/recovery-state.js), threads canonical recovery metadata through [api-response.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/contracts/api-response.js), keeps the existing public shell in [DashboardLiveScreen.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/dashboard/components/DashboardLiveScreen.tsx) and [dashboard-presenter.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/dashboard/presenters/dashboard-presenter.js), and exposes restart evidence in the existing local-only ops path via [get-ops-health.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/ops/get-ops-health.js), [OpsShellClient.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/components/OpsShellClient.tsx), and [run-ops-maintenance-action.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/ops/run-ops-maintenance-action.js).

Coverage was added in [dashboard.live-path.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/dashboard.live-path.test.mjs), [ops-health.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-health.test.mjs), [ops-maintenance-action.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-maintenance-action.test.mjs), [ops-shell.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-shell.test.mjs), and [startup-smoke.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs). `npm run validate` passed. The story is updated to `review` in [3-5-recover-the-display-after-interruption-or-restart.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/3-5-recover-the-display-after-interruption-or-restart.md) and [sprint-status.yaml](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml). Validation also refreshed runtime snapshot artifacts under `runtime/snapshots/`.
